Universal Massive File System (UMFS) ChangeLog
===============================================

2026-10-25
----------

Documentation
* Added README.tr.md, a Turkish (Türkiye) translation of the README.
* Linked the English and Turkish READMEs to each other and listed README.tr.md
  in the project layout.

Website
* Added the full GNU Affero General Public License v3.0-or-later notice to the
  header comment of index.html.
* Added the full English GNU Affero General Public License notice to the CSS
  and JavaScript source comments.
* Updated the UMFS Authors copyright attribution to 2026-2027 in the source
  file notices and the website license section and footer.

Documentation
* Kept the full GNU Affero General Public License notice in English in both
  README files and documented the source-file license notices.

2026-09-25
----------

Documentation
* Added README.md with an overview of the Universal Massive File System website
  and its role in the amassivus datacenter suite.
* Documented the files included in this static website and the local serving
  instructions.
* Documented the Bootstrap 5.3.3 jsDelivr dependency and the lack of a build
  step, backend, storage service, API, or datacenter control plane in this
  checkout.
* Documented the responsive navigation behavior provided by the local JavaScript.
* Documented the content boundaries around the comparison table and directed
  readers to the UMFS source and technical documentation for implementation
  details.
* Added licensing and contribution guidance to the README.

Website
* Recorded the current public-facing UMFS presentation: project identity, hero
  content, overview, datacenter-suite positioning, comparison table, license
  section, and source links.
* Recorded the existing GNU Affero General Public License v3.0-or-later notices
  and the 2026 UMFS Authors copyright attribution.
